Make TensorFlow tensors in MediaPipe graphs optional.

Inputs and outputs of type tensorflow::Tensor in MediaPipe graphs need
the TensorFlow framework library, which builds only with Bazel and which
Guix lacks.  With TFTENSOR_DISABLE set to 1, leave out the code for them;
requests with such tensors then get NOT_IMPLEMENTED.  The other tensor
types are not affected.

